                    tellers.

bs c50 2a 20        Build on c50 2 A-type ships, investing 20 tellers.

bs t 20             Add 20 tellers to cover building ships  expenses  on  the
                    current planet.

bs c50 t 20         Add 20 tellers to cover building ships expenses on planet
                    c50.
